B.bP2=s(["Bones are hardening, limbs are lengthening, and facial expressions become possible.","Kidneys make urine, and baby practices swallowing amniotic fluid.","Fine hair patterns and early skin protection begin developing."],t.s)
B.bV0=s(["Some people, especially in later pregnancies, may notice early flutters.","Baby can make more coordinated movements, though they may still be too subtle to feel."],t.s)
B.c0I=s(["Energy may improve, and nausea may ease, but round-ligament pain can start.","Congestion, gum sensitivity, skin changes, and headaches can appear.","A bump may become more noticeable as the uterus rises."],t.s)
B.bIf=s(["Steady protein, iron-rich foods, calcium, vitamin D, and hydration support growth and blood-volume changes.","If cravings increase, pair fun foods with fiber/protein where possible.","Continue food-safety basics and discuss caffeine limits with your clinician."],t.s)
B.bPk=s(["Review screening results and plan/confirm the anatomy scan window.","Discuss exercise, pelvic/back pain, sleep, and any work/travel considerations."],t.s)
B.c_2=s(["Bleeding, fluid leakage, severe/worsening abdominal pain, fever, severe headache, visual changes, or fainting.","Pain or swelling in one leg, chest pain, or difficulty breathing."],t.s)
B.ai8=new A.ps("Weeks 13\u201316: Growing into the second trimester","Second trimester \xb7 growth & energy shift","Lemon / avocado","2.9\u20134.6 in","0.8\u20133.5 oz","A tiny fetus with longer limbs and a defined profile",B.NF,B.aCk,B.bP2,B.bV0,B.c0I,B.bIf,B.bPk,B.c_2)
B.aE_=new A.k(1,0.7098039215686275,0.4235294117647059,1,B.q)
B.awX=new A.k(1,1,0.7019607843137254,0.8196078431372549,B.q)
B.bWv=s(["The fertilized egg implants and begins forming the early embryo and placenta.","The gestational sac and yolk sac begin supporting early growth.","The neural tube groundwork begins very early, which is why folic acid matters."],t.s)
B.bT3=s(["No movement can be felt yet \u2014 cells are rapidly organizing into major body systems.","Early heart and nervous-system foundations are beginning to form."],t.s)
B.bZe=s(["You may feel normal, or notice fatigue, breast tenderness, cramping, spotting, or nausea.","Light spotting can occur with implantation, but heavy bleeding or severe pain needs prompt care.","Medication, alcohol, smoking/vaping, and supplement questions are worth reviewing early with a clinician."],t.s)
B.bN0=s(["Prioritize folic acid/folate, iron-rich foods, protein, calcium, and hydration.","Small frequent meals can help if nausea starts.","Avoid high-mercury fish, unpasteurized foods, and unsafe food-handling risks."],t.s)
B.bVp=s(["Confirm pregnancy, estimate due date, review medications/supplements, and plan first prenatal visit.","Ask which symptoms should trigger urgent care in your region."],t.s)
B.bHk=s(["Heavy bleeding, one-sided pelvic pain, shoulder-tip pain, fainting/dizziness, fever, or severe abdominal pain.","Severe dehydration from vomiting or inability to keep fluids down."],t.s)
B.ai9=new A.ps("Weeks 1\u20134: Tiny beginning","First trimester \xb7 implantation & early placenta support","Poppy seed / sesame seed","<0.2 in","Too tiny to measure","A tiny cluster embedding in the uterine lining",B.aE_,B.awX,B.bWv,B.bT3,B.bZe,B.bN0,B.bVp,B.bHk)
B.aDB=new A.k(1,1,0.5529411764705883,0.6196078431372549,B.q)
B.bUr=s(["Baby gains fat quickly and looks less wrinkled over time.","Lungs and brain continue rapid maturation.","Bones are formed but still soft/flexible for birth."],t.s)
B.bM0=s(["Movement may feel like rolls, stretches, jabs, or pressure as space gets tighter.","Patterns matter more than exact counts; report meaningful decreases promptly."],t.s)
B.bCw=s(["Pelvic pressure, frequent urination, reflux, leg cramps, and fatigue can intensify.","Gentle movement, stretching, hydration, and rest breaks may help comfort.","Planning support for postpartum recovery becomes practical now."],t.s)
B.b6Q=s(["Focus on nutrient density: protein, iron, calcium, vitamin D, fiber, and omega-3s.","Smaller meals may be easier if reflux or early fullness is strong.","Hydration supports constipation, headaches, and overall wellbeing."],t.s)
B.bPn=s(["Discuss fetal position, growth, symptoms, birth preferences, feeding plans, and postpartum support.","Review warning signs and when to call after hours."],t.s)
B.bJU=s(["Reduced movement, bleeding, fluid leakage, regular contractions, severe pelvic pressure, or fever.","Severe headache, vision changes, sudden swelling, right-upper abdominal pain, chest pain, or shortness of breath."],t.s)
