B.ao7=new A.d8("First trimester prenatal visit","Recommended soon",7,u.J,"Early pregnancy care usually focuses on confirming dating, reviewing medical history, medications, symptoms, and screening options.","Cover due-date confirmation, prenatal labs, nausea/vomiting, bleeding or cramping, medications, supplements, genetic screening options, and warning signs.","Bring last menstrual period or dating scan details, medication list, supplements, nausea severity, bleeding/cramping notes, and screening questions.","pregnancy_first_trimester_visit",B.c1k,62)
B.dck=new A.IA(B.ao7,!1,84)
B.bKD=s(["pregnancy_timeline","second_trimester"],t.s)
B.aoj=new A.d8("Second trimester prenatal check","Routine care",21,u.J,"Second trimester care commonly reviews anatomy-scan follow-up, symptom patterns, blood pressure, nutrition, movement expectations, and upcoming glucose/iron screening.","Ask about anatomy scan results, fetal movement expectations, blood pressure/urine checks, glucose screening timing, iron, vaccines, exercise, and symptoms from your logs.","Bring anatomy scan questions, symptoms, nutrition concerns, medication/supplement list, and anything you want explained before third trimester.","pregnancy_second_trimester_visit",B.bKD,50)
B.dcl=new A.IA(B.aoj,!1,56)
B.bKb=s(["pregnancy_timeline","late_pregnancy"],t.s)
B.anY=new A.d8("Late pregnancy weekly check","Routine upcoming",7,u.J,"In late pregnancy, visits often focus on fetal movement, blood pressure, labor signs, birth setting logistics, and post-dates or induction planning if needed.","Review when to call or go in, contractions, fluid leakage, bleeding, fetal movement, blood pressure warning signs, Group B strep if relevant, induction/post-dates planning, and postpartum/newborn follow-up.","Bring labor-sign questions, birth logistics, fetal movement notes, symptoms, induction/post-dates questions, and postpartum support plans.","pregnancy_late_weekly_check",B.bKb,66)
B.dcm=new A.IA(B.anY,!0,7)
B.bZ_=s(["pregnancy_stage"],t.s)
B.aob=new A.d8("Prenatal care visit","Routine care",14,u.J,"Contessa does not have a due date yet, so it is using a general pregnancy appointment recommendation.","Confirm gestational age, due date, current symptoms, medications, supplements, screening plans, and when your next visit should happen.","Bring due date information if known, current symptoms, medications, supplements, and questions for your provider.","pregnancy_general_prenatal_visit",B.bZ_,45)
B.dcn=new A.IA(B.aob,!1,42)
B.bJQ=s(["pregnancy_timeline","third_trimester"],t.s)
B.aof=new A.d8("Third trimester prenatal visit","Routine upcoming",14,u.J,"Third trimester visits usually become more frequent and focus on growth, fetal movement, blood pressure, birth planning, vaccines, and symptom changes.","Review fetal movement, growth, blood pressure symptoms, swelling/headache/vision changes, vaccines, birth preferences, feeding plans if relevant, and next visit cadence.","Bring kick-count or movement questions, symptoms, birth-plan questions, hospital/birth-centre logistics, and postpartum support questions.","pregnancy_third_trimester_visit",B.bJQ,56)
